.DS_Store

# Release simulator images build the per-cloud binaries. Test harnesses,
# generated test binaries, Terraform caches, and UI build artifacts are not
# part of the runtime image source context.
**/sdk-tests
**/cli-tests
**/terraform-tests
**/*.test
**/dist

# Locally built simulator binaries.
aws/simulator-aws
gcp/simulator-gcp
azure/simulator-azure

# Terraform and local runtime artifacts can appear under test directories.
**/.terraform
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.backup
**/.stack-pids
